{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4863546b8c93a095e98e4b0b71eba00c24833f78005d6792baf9d8e0e7f7a9e2", "ja": "エボリューション・バタフライ", "zh": "进化蝶变", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a8bcac24402a3aee0580a7f3854b0f72473d9c6b882c1dbf75ea84ec27d23573", "ja": "プロデューサーは「美希を振り向かせたい」\nというエレナの想いを聞く。しかしそのせい\nで美希を寂しくさせていたかも、と気付いた\nエレナは美希と話し合う。打ち解けたふたり\nは、さらなる成長を予感させるのだった。", "zh": "制作人听到了艾蕾娜“想让美希回心转意”的心意。然而，她意识到自己或许因此让美希感到寂寞，便和美希进行了一番交谈。两人敞开心扉，仿佛预示着她们将迎来更进一步的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "151650c6e75684b3b624fae4d5d93be740e079da8772350ab74492c4ea9fd77a", "ja": "（エレナの行動もだいぶ怪しかったけど、\n美希も、何か気にしてるみたいだったな）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜的行动确实相当可疑，不过美希好像也在介意什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0b274b3b26cfbf1e37bb37a3df5364c78606beeca5dabd25228e7ec74cbffa63", "ja": "ここは、ふたりからちゃんと話を聞いて……\nあれ？", "zh": "我先好好听听她们两个怎么说……\n咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "116adbf5989d596fd2d0087ee9106213d80630eb791d1d2fd876c7bc0531b980", "ja": "おはよー！\n{$P$}！", "zh": "早上好——！\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a0b1e898347304b0aa978e3dc0778a31eb4f82a7b863c4285a1f99edcfcf7ed0", "ja": "おはよう、エレナ。\n早いんだな。", "zh": "早上好，艾蕾娜。\n来得真早啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "7eef9221201f3790bc8a6ec851f17c6430b44ed4e33e86aaa66953a529c5770c", "ja": "うん！\nミキが来る前にレッスンしておきたかったし。", "zh": "嗯！\n因为想在美希来之前先练习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "f57dc8af00c144958de082675e3b47bed2f6a7df12a00245a971ac66ca285709", "ja": "それに、ミキのこと観察しなくちゃだから……\nあっ、ミキにはナイショだヨ！", "zh": "而且，我还得观察美希才行……\n啊，这件事可不能告诉美希哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5002465b1feeb42449b458f9a1c1a2781f5df2a264a0791f8d3f9a6e4d291516", "ja": "観察……昨日のは、そういう事だったのか。\nでも、どうしてそんな？", "zh": "观察……昨天那件事，原来是这么回事啊。\n不过，为什么要那样做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "119cc9aedb8081435e0f8491bf5c3478fda82686a5043d84253fe527e8e1e5b2", "ja": "ミキのこと、もっと知りたいからだヨ。仲良くなるには\n相手を知るべきだって、コノミたちが教えてくれたノ。", "zh": "因为我想更了解美希嘛。要和对方变得要好，就应该先了解对方，这是木实她们教我的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "09f7fefb735ea516dccb48233980477c29ccc41ccfe4840c0f3d155622f35390", "ja": "でも、ミキはライバルでもあるでしょ？\nだから、こっそり覗いてたんだけど……。", "zh": "可是，美希也是竞争对手吧？\n所以我才偷偷观察她的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "951e1ee3edeac976ac8c9a044f2b0771a1866af2c974dfe56029b080519c4788", "ja": "なるほど、このみさん達が……。\n確かに、相手の事を知るのは大事だな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这个美小姐她们啊……。的确，了解对手是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "7ebb827ef911d704f6278c6f5cdb84c2fad0b4246a6a55a8d004d77a50b01385", "ja": "でもネ……ワタシ、ミキを見てて、\nちょっとだけわかったコトがあるヨ。", "zh": "不过呢……我看着美希，稍微明白了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "eca1495185a216175bea44ee76e32f79db7b6bb81da49d3087917cd9b19d3cae", "ja": "ミキはフワフワしてるけど、本気になった時は、\n本当にすごいよネ。劇場の誰よりも……。", "zh": "美希平时虽然有些迷迷糊糊的，但她认真起来的时候，真的很厉害呢。比剧场里的任何人都要厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "05462bd3663638bd10571a76f7ba919f334b713d2d9fcfb63f11818af7cf87ac", "ja": "ワタシはバックダンサーじゃなくて、デュオだから……\nミキのこと、ちゃんと振り向かせたいノ！", "zh": "我不是伴舞，而是双人组合……所以，我想让美希真正注意到我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f7d28b2cc700e10d43308d35d18156c5d33637c07bff59e27f4bcc0386b8b3d3", "ja": "振り向かせる……美希を？", "zh": "让美希回头……是说美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "6c7294e1a3352a5559747cc46dd672bb750d7c6d2d88a0a2f58e70b800dae04a", "ja": "うん！　……新曲をもらった時、ワタシは、\nとってもステキな曲だと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "嗯！……拿到新歌的时候，我觉得那是一首特别棒的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "a7359a9afa6685530fdafdc156ea516feba1908430028ffceb73f33c84779c04", "ja": "ミキはあんまりよろこんでなかったから、\n違うのかもって……ちょっと、気になってたノ。", "zh": "因为美希好像不太高兴，\n所以我有点在意……会不会不是那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "9a3a34aec25abd90ad265332c9b02d0b36e6ac5f2f682e06e161d91121702e5a", "ja": "だから……ミキに、\nもっとワタシのこと、見てほしくて……。", "zh": "所以……我希望美希能更多地注视我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fbb198d0e0847998726b9d1a3745b6b1bf4dafae8cc6148e86e8bc8ae75cd009", "ja": "なるほど、そういう理由だったのか。出張のせいで\nフォローができなくて、申し訳なかったけど……。", "zh": "原来如此，是因为这个原因啊。因为出差没能照顾到你，真的很抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5c2ce244a774b6d248c0f74dcb371a41f5c0819d0d5667802d2e647012d8f81a", "ja": "でも……もしかしたら今は、美希のほうが\nそういう気持ちになっちゃってるかもしれないな。", "zh": "不过……说不定现在，反倒是美希有了那种心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "116894efbbff6c8be59cbec953f268dfbdb6eb28a95f8f8ec147b16e52ac5719", "ja": "え？　……ミキが？", "zh": "诶？……美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bdd66d05c98ad9ac21c5da119343334d6a0589a6a1bcab3e89f6f7c5d4ea4c0d", "ja": "美希が少し、寂しそうに見えたから。もしかしたら、\n仲間はずれになったように感じてるのかもなって。", "zh": "因为美希看起来有点寂寞。我想，她可能觉得自己被排除在外了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "f3c15454b23324e5b0c42df9fba8d947b32122f474384fdd26cdd9cbadaee505", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そんなことしないヨ！\nワタシたち、ただ、ミキと仲良くしたくて……。", "zh": "诶！？才、才不会做那种事呢！\n我们只是想和美希好好相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6f854fcfc1e865ab7b6f2148425c331a3380036cdf70e659ee9ac5488df90374", "ja": "うん。だったらそのまま、\nまっすぐ来てほしかったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯。如果是那样的话，\n她或许更希望你们直接了当地来找她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cbe5dd63b252360bcb94e73b5203d3843905d216539bb7eebaccf5d1de97ded4", "ja": "エレナが収録を見学してた時の美希は、\nうれしそうだっただろ？", "zh": "艾丽娜来参观录制时，美希看起来很开心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "e7dc5bc8d1b5409aaee87538b4434c490d3350150ceb8fa6961930cdff96c00e", "ja": "ワタシ、ミキに笑顔になってほしかったのに……\nミキのこと、ほったらかしにしてたかも……。", "zh": "我本来是想让美希露出笑容的……\n但我好像把美希丢在一边不管了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "72fea1050e3d80df25a2287dbeb00101ce59160c68ef209d8eccb33222ad1de1", "ja": "あふぅ……おはよ～、\n{$P$}、エレナ。", "zh": "哈啊……早安～，\n{$P$}、艾莲娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "938c9e70cc25805a701cae4eb0eff00278cc9adfafb15b2b54f1d3f4423c77a9", "ja": "あっ、ミキ！\n……あの、ごめんネ。ワタシ……。", "zh": "啊，美希！\n……那个，对不起哦。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "bbb8f30090a60b35f443e78a41c95f0d72357d62e0490de8ce6449ada569b8eb", "ja": "？　なんのこと？　それよりエレナ、\n新曲の振り付けだけど、アレンジしてみない？", "zh": "嗯？什么事？不如说，关于新歌的编舞，要不要试着改编一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c9ca71fa85dde8be0c54fe9370eadc795367f6853aaa80e57c2d32539350229", "ja": "え？　振り付けをアレンジ？", "zh": "咦？要改编舞蹈动作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "fdb358025c67714b7c3edcf8b03ba0d43b274f3168b2ab2432e893fa23c819fc", "ja": "ダンス、今のままだとタイクツかもって。\nエレナも、カッコよくしたいって言ってたでしょ？", "zh": "舞蹈要是一直保持现在这样，可能会有点无聊。\n艾蕾娜不是也说过，想让它变得更帅气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "1348ac49bb2f453bb877953641eb1818947b6c38e614fa93e6ecb105b9b9a34c", "ja": "ちょっと難しくなるけど、\nミキとエレナならいけるって思うな。", "zh": "虽然会变得有点难，但我觉得美希和艾蕾娜一定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "37ff1e7228c13716c75e2b087c70fbf87d98158802c2dac260470a66d7fbb351", "ja": "み……ミキ～！！！\n大好きだヨーーー！！！！！", "zh": "美……美希～！！！\n最喜欢你啦——！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "ec84214a7263948b70b4852d473c688ad8b2b11b738fd7ceb33cd51a0ed46856", "ja": "キャッ！？　……なんなの～？", "zh": "呀！？……这是什么情况～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "57df293d7dd7b8e087b3b65befafe96ca425a33f41c0be34fa08ec5a0f4bb815", "ja": "なるほど、そんなことがあったのね。", "zh": "原来如此，发生过这样的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "bddebb3fb6ea1d068014777310c6aa03fa94912c8c527ff878c6c59716a749d2", "ja": "ごめんなさいね、{$P$}。\n私がついていたのに、フォローできなくて……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。明明有我陪着你，却没能帮上忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3c5ad8118edac4125b6ef5522cc3f34f73c9f577e37b0faf557fb4ca8cc950de", "ja": "いえ。最終的に、悪い方向にはいかなかったので。\nむしろ俺がいない間、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "不会。毕竟事情最终也没有往坏的方向发展。\n倒是我不在的这段时间，多亏了你，非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "24d4f5a70baae398610f515042892b19809148c70dbb3da38b51a82fe04b11b0", "ja": "相手が美希なせいか、ウチらも構えすぎたかもな。\nライバルである前に、劇場の仲間なんだし。", "zh": "对手是美希的缘故，我们可能也太过戒备了吧。  \n在成为对手之前，我们可是剧场的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "072b4fd148536622ab5c7ab1e8de5b16236163f1d0e370bd1a0e20d900e6ac93", "ja": "ライバルである前に、劇場の仲間……\nたしかに、そうですよね。", "zh": "在成为对手之前，我们是剧场的伙伴……确实是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ca6f531c413ddde526b8ccf96110ec9ed5a5c6f9a75fbaea720d4a958d578453", "ja": "そういう事だな。", "zh": "就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "afcd895454bfa444bdc13905c233eadf463af6fcfb7bd0dbf275d5bc59652ec9", "ja": "ワタシ、ミキとのデュオがすっごく楽しみなノ。\nだからミキにも、楽しんでほしくて……。", "zh": "我特别期待和美希一起组成双人组合。\n所以也希望美希能享受其中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "6729241127cc7a63df9be1b49f289185c6ee0c88906f69b5c2c9e83728f98be2", "ja": "でも、ミキに負けたくない気持ちもあって……\nごめんネ、ミキ。", "zh": "但我也有不想输给美希的心情……\n对不起哦，美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "399cbf17d5f64a2dc638d55bfdf01f10d2dbebf42400a8e5654b91acbb019222", "ja": "な～んだ。だったら、そう言えばよかったの。\n今回は、ミキとエレナのデュオなんだから。", "zh": "原来是这样。那你直接说出来不就好了。\n这次可是美希和艾丽娜的双人组合呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d0127132fceffea3c5e47820a36ba9d78947e7ae7ea3a6877b76ee20ad6449e", "ja": "ミキ……うんっ！　今度の公演、\n絶対に、すごいステージにしようね！", "zh": "美希……嗯！下次的公演，我们一定要打造出超棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "061d257a8505278c7ae427240d41a97552455465d0ba73ff5d8c8dac888e3fde", "ja": "もちろんなの。\nミキ、エレナには負けないし。あはっ☆", "zh": "当然啦。\n美希才不会输给艾丽娜。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "68cb8aaf13917e28ade22ae06dca77cf75241b64db38a4be523a27112cc84495", "ja": "ひとまず大団円、って感じかしら？\nお姉さんたちの出番も、ここまでね。", "zh": "暂时算是大团圆了吧？\n姐姐们也就到此为止了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "8ac9c2c55d70b28b51ae90e0123914424c041e02329c5e03850916228b0fb37f", "ja": "美希さんが寂しがってたって、本当でしょうか。\n……なんだか意外です。", "zh": "听说美希小姐觉得寂寞，是真的吗？……总觉得有点意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "35623e3e3ef9a75dc887ff26a252d21b64dc4a4085639ae331406c98ec4fb46e", "ja": "ま、美希もまだ中学生だしな。\nかわいいところがあるっていうか……。", "zh": "不过，美希也还是个初中生嘛。\n该说她也有可爱的一面呢，还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1049_003mik", "source_sha256": "30793beac38f73c678500282cd21e262b8c45bb82d3d86f5c19269ed52a18209", "ja": "ねえねえ、ミキとエレナはデュオだよね？\n明日からの取材、いっしょに来てくれる？", "zh": "呐呐，美希和艾丽娜是二重唱对吧？\n从明天开始的采访，你愿意和我一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "aab13f5102c08dedfa257361cce13165244034ab457f51cba78856aa07ab1f28", "ja": "もちろん！　けど、行っていいノ？\n{$P$}は……。", "zh": "当然可以！不过，我可以去吗？\n{$P$}那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "6ced02d3359f1554349ff8f59da92800d5dbaefc3e2432fbd7a1e41577badd7b", "ja": "劇場の宣伝になるって言ってたし、絶対大丈夫なの！\nね、{$P$}？", "zh": "你不是说这也能宣传剧场嘛，所以绝对没问题的！对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1052_p", "source_sha256": "bc7eb145fe4d63628ecfc98de5a5335211cc255d457482a6259dc6161f758d03", "ja": "え？　ああ、まあ確かに、宣伝にはなるけど。\nただ取材だし、相手に確認を……。", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯，确实能起到宣传作用。不过毕竟是采访，还是得先跟对方确认一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1053_003mik", "source_sha256": "32bcc2c3be7c112f305dffd98db14fa5bee0a46cb01174008226fc00f9de0c6c", "ja": "やった～なの～！\nこれで、お仕事がすこし楽になるの……あふ。", "zh": "成功啦～！\n这样一来，工作就能轻松一点了……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e9aae0cf3f614e114a5cbe2fe045336d73cc693a573e490bfa013dc16e5ac40", "ja": "美希のやつ……もしかして、エレナに\n仕事を押し付けるタイミングを図ってたのか……？", "zh": "美希那家伙……难道是在等时机，把工作推给艾蕾娜吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1055_039kon", "source_sha256": "aa91febd162048bac0d7b1c9541c201c3bcfe943663edefdabdf60cce6322afb", "ja": "エレナちゃん……美希ちゃんを攻略するどころか、\n攻略されちゃったみたいね……。", "zh": "艾莉娜……别说攻略美希了，反倒像是被她攻略了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "802dccec1b1312631fff891e3322303350f65d320a85ced0d97c2aaafc646ee1", "ja": "で、でも。美希さんが提案した\nダンスアレンジは、すごかったですから……。", "zh": "可、可是。美希提出的舞蹈编排，确实很厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ddecf178a3a5d32d0d09af1c3a61bef0878ccc8c0c242b106ea8feb0adf0fc46", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうだな！\n期待しておこう！", "zh": "啊、啊啊。是啊！那就期待一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_06_1058_p", "source_sha256": "9772cacaa541487e35e107d870278e7f8903e6a6713d0e531b8bbdcaea2d9463", "ja": "（あのふたりならきっと、予想を超えてきてくれる。\nどんな事でも……な！）", "zh": "（那两个人一定会超出预想。不管是什么事……对吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
